> Conclusion

Independent values and derivatives explain each loss before optimization. Exact tensor distances retain the source geometry with higher axis-wise cost. The four fits demonstrate reconstruction of a known mask; they do not measure held-out segmentation or compare CNN architectures.

> References

- [Salehi et al.(2017), Tversky loss function for image segmentation using3D fully convolutional deep networks](https://arxiv.org/abs/1706.05721).
- [Berman et al.(2018), The Lovász-Softmax loss](https://arxiv.org/abs/1705.08790).
- [Kervadec et al.(2019), Boundary loss for highly unbalanced segmentation](https://arxiv.org/abs/1812.07032).
